# { } → dictionary → labeled data
# [ ] → list → collection/order of things
# ( ) → function calls / other structures
# { }  = DATA CONTAINER

# "HP": 15000
# = KEY + VALUE
# [ ]  = GET SOMETHING FROM THE DATA
# =    = SET the value
# -=   = TAKE AWAY
# +=   = ADD

# So when you see:

# crab_mech["HP"] -= 100

# read it like English:

# Crab Mech → HP → subtract 100.

# And:

# crab_mech["HP"] += 300

# means:

# Crab Mech → HP → add 300.